{"uid":"eaee8a16ab265d45","name":"test_a_resume_after_an_operator_termination_leaves_no_termination_key_once_it_ends_clean","fullName":"tests.test_episode_scoped_ending#test_a_resume_after_an_operator_termination_leaves_no_termination_key_once_it_ends_clean","historyId":"343bc20c89b812170148259d853098f6","time":{"start":1791921685978,"stop":1791921685979,"duration":1},"description":"THE regression this task fixes, as reported by #173: a run stopped by\n    an operator two episodes ago, then resumed into a clean success, must\n    not still carry `termination` (a `--json` consumer, the hub, or any\n    future classifier reading it would see an aborted run that in fact\n    succeeded).\n\n    Absence, not `termination: null`: the ONE question every consumer of this\n    field asks is \"was this run told to stop?\", and a present-but-null key\n    answers that with \"the key is here\" for anyone testing presence (`\"in\"`,\n    `hasOwnProperty`, a jq `has(\"termination\")`). So this asserts the key is\n    gone from status.json outright -- the first attempt at this task left it\n    at `null` and the looser \"absent OR null\" assertion hid it.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>THE regression this task fixes, as reported by #173: a run stopped by<br />\nan operator two episodes ago, then resumed into a clean success, must<br />\nnot still carry <code>termination</code> (a <code>--json</code> consumer, the hub, or any<br />\nfuture classifier reading it would see an aborted run that in fact<br />\nsucceeded).</p>\n<pre><code>Absence, not `termination: null`: the ONE question every consumer of this\nfield asks is &quot;was this run told to stop?&quot;, and a present-but-null key\nanswers that with &quot;the key is here&quot; for anyone testing presence (`&quot;in&quot;`,\n`hasOwnProperty`, a jq `has(&quot;termination&quot;)`). So this asserts the key is\ngone from status.json outright -- the first attempt at this task left it\nat `null` and the looser &quot;absent OR null&quot; assertion hid it.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791921685866,"stop":1791921685866,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791921685867,"stop":1791921685870,"duration":3},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791921685870,"stop":1791921685870,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791921685871,"stop":1791921685874,"duration":3},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_wait_out_backoff_at_class_level","time":{"start":1791921685874,"stop":1791921685875,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_escalation_backoff_at_class_level","time":{"start":1791921685874,"stop":1791921685874,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_undo_instant_sleep_patches","time":{"start":1791921685875,"stop":1791921685875,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"paramete